        ],
        "text": "The interpretation of \u201cprison conditions\u201d determines whether prisoners can bring single\u2011episode excessive\u2011force claims without first exhausting prison grievance procedures."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "999e596db5f1ec357110278cf14fd282cc74e136867e0cc9eced962e5067b97c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-999e596db5f1-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 36,
              "start": 36
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Congress expressed concern about the large volume of prison lawsuits and intended the PLRA to streamline them, suggesting no carve\u2011out for single\u2011incident excessive\u2011force cases."
      }
